      "role": "agent",
      "start_time": 9.3,
      "end_time": 24.51,
      "duration": 15.21,
      "transcript": "Sure! We offer several billing options, including monthly billing, auto-pay with a saved payment method, and one-time payments by card or bank transfer. If you tell me whether you're looking for monthly or auto-pay, I can guide you to the best setup.",
      "transcript_truncated": true
